</div></div><div class="CtaBanner-module-scss-module__0Cqcuq__text"><p class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-5-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance CtaBanner-module-scss-module__0Cqcuq__headline">The Claude Security Plugin for Claude Code is now in beta</p><div class="text-rich-text CtaBanner-module-scss-module__0Cqcuq__body"><p class="text-body-2">Scan, validate, and patch directly inside Claude Code while keeping all code inside your environment.</p></div></div></div><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup CtaBanner-module-scss-module__0Cqcuq__ctas"><a href="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/claude-security" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-primary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-mainSmall text-body-3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="ctaBanner" data-cta-url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/claude-security">Learn more<span class="sr-only" lang="en" data-export-skip=""> (opens in new tab)</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section id="featureList" data-section="featureList" data-cta-section="featureList" class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__wrapper theme-main"><div class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__borderTop"></div><div class="container"><div class="grid-12"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__inner FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__fullWidth"><div class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__introBlock IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__spacingBelowLarge FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__intro" style="--intro-headline-width:30ch"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__base Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__size-large IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__pictogram" role="img" aria-label="Magnifying glass icon with intricate gears and mechanical code patterns inside, representing code analysis or debugging tools"></div><h2 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-1-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__heading IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__headline IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__headlineBalance" style="--word-stagger:0.03333333333333333s" aria-label="Built for security teams, used by Anthropic"><span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:0" aria-hidden="true">Built</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:1" aria-hidden="true">for</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:2" aria-hidden="true">security</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:3" aria-hidden="true">teams,</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:4" aria-hidden="true">used</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:5" aria-hidden="true">by</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:6" aria-hidden="true">Anthropic</span></h2></div><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__8zH9eW__container FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__list FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__vertical FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__iconPrimary" style="--reveal-y:20px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.1s"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:0"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2.5C14.1421 2.5 17.5 5.85786 17.5 10C17.5 14.1421 14.1421 17.5 10 17.5C5.85786 17.5 2.5 14.1421 2.5 10C2.5 5.85786 5.85786 2.5 10 2.5ZM13.3125 7.10938C13.0969 6.93689 12.7819 6.97188 12.6094 7.1875L8.95801 11.751L7.35352 10.1465L7.27539 10.082C7.08131 9.95388 6.81734 9.97563 6.64648 10.1465C6.47563 10.3173 6.45388 10.5813 6.58203 10.7754L6.64648 10.8535L8.64648 12.8535L8.72852 12.9199C8.81649 12.9768 8.92098 13.0048 9.02734 12.999C9.16935 12.9912 9.30178 12.9236 9.39062 12.8125L13.3906 7.8125C13.5631 7.59687 13.5281 7.28188 13.3125 7.10938Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Transparency and visibility</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-2">See details about every finding: the vulnerability, why it matters, and the proposed fix</p></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:1"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2.5C14.1421 2.5 17.5 5.85786 17.5 10C17.5 14.1421 14.1421 17.5 10 17.5C5.85786 17.5 2.5 14.1421 2.5 10C2.5 5.85786 5.85786 2.5 10 2.5ZM13.3125 7.10938C13.0969 6.93689 12.7819 6.97188 12.6094 7.1875L8.95801 11.751L7.35352 10.1465L7.27539 10.082C7.08131 9.95388 6.81734 9.97563 6.64648 10.1465C6.47563 10.3173 6.45388 10.5813 6.58203 10.7754L6.64648 10.8535L8.64648 12.8535L8.72852 12.9199C8.81649 12.9768 8.92098 13.0048 9.02734 12.999C9.16935 12.9912 9.30178 12.9236 9.39062 12.8125L13.3906 7.8125C13.5631 7.59687 13.5281 7.28188 13.3125 7.10938Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Targeted patches</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-2">Suggested fixes that maintain your code&#x27;s structure and style</p></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:2"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2.5C14.1421 2.5 17.5 5.85786 17.5 10C17.5 14.1421 14.1421 17.5 10 17.5C5.85786 17.5 2.5 14.1421 2.5 10C2.5 5.85786 5.85786 2.5 10 2.5ZM13.3125 7.10938C13.0969 6.93689 12.7819 6.97188 12.6094 7.1875L8.95801 11.751L7.35352 10.1465L7.27539 10.082C7.08131 9.95388 6.81734 9.97563 6.64648 10.1465C6.47563 10.3173 6.45388 10.5813 6.58203 10.7754L6.64648 10.8535L8.64648 12.8535L8.72852 12.9199C8.81649 12.9768 8.92098 13.0048 9.02734 12.999C9.16935 12.9912 9.30178 12.9236 9.39062 12.8125L13.3906 7.8125C13.5631 7.59687 13.5281 7.28188 13.3125 7.10938Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Fits your existing workflow</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-2">Get findings into your tools through webhooks and the API, then review and resolve them without leaving Claude Code</p></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:3"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2.5C14.1421 2.5 17.5 5.85786 17.5 10C17.5 14.1421 14.1421 17.5 10 17.5C5.85786 17.5 2.5 14.1421 2.5 10C2.5 5.85786 5.85786 2.5 10 2.5ZM13.3125 7.10938C13.0969 6.93689 12.7819 6.97188 12.6094 7.1875L8.95801 11.751L7.35352 10.1465L7.27539 10.082C7.08131 9.95388 6.81734 9.97563 6.64648 10.1465C6.47563 10.3173 6.45388 10.5813 6.58203 10.7754L6.64648 10.8535L8.64648 12.8535L8.72852 12.9199C8.81649 12.9768 8.92098 13.0048 9.02734 12.999C9.16935 12.9912 9.30178 12.9236 9.39062 12.8125L13.3906 7.8125C13.5631 7.59687 13.5281 7.28188 13.3125 7.10938Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Full remediation control</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-2">Teams stay in control, with every patch requiring human review and approval</p></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:4"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2.5C14.1421 2.5 17.5 5.85786 17.5 10C17.5 14.1421 14.1421 17.5 10 17.5C5.85786 17.5 2.5 14.1421 2.5 10C2.5 5.85786 5.85786 2.5 10 2.5ZM13.3125 7.10938C13.0969 6.93689 12.7819 6.97188 12.6094 7.1875L8.95801 11.751L7.3