Team, and Enterprise users can access Claude Code on the \u003ca\u003eClaude desktop app\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"Vn/B4Q2FzQ\":\"By continuing, you acknowledge Anthropic's \u003ca\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e and agree to get occasional promotional emails and notifications.\",\"VuaUNdEnAQ\":\"Pull every document tagged to the witness in Everlaw, build a chronology of key events, and put deposition questions in a spreadsheet, organized by topic, one row per question, with the supporting document cited and a column to mark each one covered.\",\"VxbwOIgVP3\":\"Reading the brand guidelines before designing anything\",\"W+iNcuRf/j\":\"For your longest tasks\",\"W0P+kwxx4c\":\"South Korea\",\"W0Tn8YkSr3\":\"Contact sales\",\"W314oPyAYP\":\"Claude Fable models are included in premium seats up to 50% of each member's weekly usage limit. Standard seats can use them with usage credits enabled. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\",\"W8nHSdskn0\":\"FAQ\",\"WAMokYC7m5\":\"Mix and match seat types\",\"WE0vBEA1sf\":\"\u003cb\u003eMore usage than Free\u003c/b\u003e, every 5 hours and every week\",\"WFI1cVp5a+\":\"{name} — in use in this session\",\"WGjpyApkxf\":\"Role-based access with fine grained permissioning\",\"WQAQ7xuRtl\":\"Super powerful terminal integration. Works with all your CLI tools alongside popular IDEs.\",\"Wc8Q9lHK1i\":\"Training and enablement\",\"WfvMAnxldt\":\"No resources for this search\",\"WiUsl4KQxR\":\"Show original\",\"WiwUy/N7ng\":\"Claude Code included\",\"Wj0bEDoJdu\":\"Intro\",\"WlfPoKGwAm\":\"Not required\",\"Wm3wd0VKYa\":\"Flag seven rows, hold four decisions\",\"WrDUUzCpU7\":\"Jump to a session using {name}\",\"Wufzvy8DSX\":\"Table of Contents\",\"WxzMBlTNvA\":\"Play: {title}\",\"WznK3aUpMC\":\"{title} — ask\",\"X+NNn3hjCL\":\"No matching {noun}\",\"X+PvShAt/r\":\"Claude "])</script><script nonce="ra8XbZYlV5PcbbCdB45pwg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"Code by Anthropic | AI coding agent and assistant\",\"X3MpW7VpdQ\":\"See it in action\",\"X65e4nNr6A\":\"Pull the latest earnings transcript and 10-Q for Dunhollow. Extract guidance, key KPIs, and commentary, compare to last quarter, and build a comps table against these peers.\",\"X6AvQomsP7\":\"Enterprise deployment for the Claude desktop app\",\"X6cK197KO5\":\"Claude for Microsoft 365\",\"X7+QFFH+jU\":\"Testimonials\",\"X95+EHwJll\":\"Open headcount-plan-v3.xlsx\",\"XCDfO+clUB\":\"I'm in \u003crole\u003e\u003c/role\u003e and I need to make the \u003ctask\u003e\u003c/task\u003e.\",\"XIsYfwEKec\":\"Write the brief\",\"XLcM6WHfQR\":\"How can I help you today?\",\"XMNoObaMmU\":\"{label}, go to the {time} card\",\"XNAhzcTNYL\":\"Run Python code in a sandboxed environment for advanced data analysis. 50 free hours of usage daily per organization.\",\"XNmgJt+Mhl\":\"All connectors\",\"XQtVbW2vWT\":\"Mark seven changes, three leveling, four fairness\",\"XTD3qNXeer\":\"In research preview on Claude Code, and is priced at $8/$40 per million tokens.\",\"XXnChAbcHf\":\"Nonprofit\",\"XXo1ivOIKB\":\"Missed the session? Stream past sessions anytime and catch up at your own pace.\",\"XY0a0CkaN4\":\"Remote — nearshore\",\"XYIVAj6Jzp\":\"Link your tools and apps, like Google Workspace or Slack, directly to Claude.\",\"Xd+A22wS4X\":\"5x more usage than standard seats*\",\"XgN4Cp51ra\":\"See pricing\",\"XoZI2iCtxL\":\"Claude Design\",\"Xp6OIvNBd2\":\"Pause testimonial audio\",\"XsXqMtdytZ\":\"Visit eight flagged sites and screenshot each\",\"XyoSUUQClA\":\"For: {label}\",\"Y/c6Wmsfjz\":\"On demand webinars\",\"YE4RPpBEqQ\":\"Now standing: after every meeting this week\",\"YKGWJSxqMY\":\"Read story\",\"YLao9+QH8h\":\"Please provide your email address if you'd like to receive our monthly developer newsletter. You can unsubscribe at any time.\",\"YMDBNHdbce\":\"Geography\",\"YMzwquqk3o\":\"Link\",\"YQQOy0ihRy\":\"Featured speakers\",\"YUPzJoJpNc\":\"Choose whether your conversations are used to improve Claude. Off by default for Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"YYX063a6ZG\":\"Search the web, create files, and run code\",\"YYot3EpUou\":\"$$20\",\"YbKpD7kDX6\":\"Interactive\",\"YkE126+GiX\":\"Up to 1M\",\"YkNJyv//Oz\":\"Trust \u0026 Safety / Platform Integrity\",\"YuZ2EYYkhH\":\"How do I get started with Claude?\",\"Yv6dvxCCkS\":\"Consumer health\",\"YxMv5HcMwA\":\"Monthly API credits\u003csup\u003e†\u003c/sup\u003e\",\"Z7xDUpgJ2K\":\"Billing cycle\",\"Z9dVg8Ob8p\":\"Claude Code follows imports across the repo, runs your tests, and keeps going when something breaks.\",\"ZG1gU8s28h\":\"Stay in control\",\"ZNBW49D95o\":\"Fill out the form below to watch on demand.\",\"ZXp0z1T7ZD\":\"Features\",\"ZYpCu5TyqM\":\"{count, plural, one {Advanced filters, # active} other {Advanced filters, # active}}\",\"ZcD4mRk7ZH\":\"There are two headcount plans in the folder — v3 is newer, but v2 still carries the contractor lines. Which is the plan of record?\",\"Zf7kOX3YGK\":\"Browse and act on the web through Claude in Chrome and the built-in browser.\",\"ZydsS37EBY\":\"Search resources\",\"Zz6QTaW0y5\":\"Available for macOS, Linux, and Windows.\",\"a10yUyliJu\":\"Fable\",\"a5LrLs/sa2\":\"Previous testimonial\",\"a5msuh5ORp\":\"Yes\",\"a5n8z1LKFj\":\"Southern Europe\",\"aC/Bx71odA\":\"Carousel\",\"aF7o2f3nQS\":\"Turn issues into PRs\",\"aMBJ4XnoAo\":\"How this customer uses Claude\",\"aPJQXN+s9F\":\"Close video\",\"aV5lC7ot7c\":\"Next generation intelligence for long-running agents\",\"aV6+0k71tl\":\"50% of weekly limits*\",\"aXlmhJkMcl\":\"Back to\",\"aakFT06xnt\":\"Install in\",\"adJ3dNrecS\":\"Compliance \u0026 Regulatory\",\"adO4gdcCQz\":\"Open Legal/Playbook.docx\",\"af7XCyr+Dn\":\"For all-day work\",\"agOXPD4vII\":\"Size\",\"ahrZTRwglI\":\"partners\",\"aw3LoyutxL\":\"Ultra\",\"awWVTjGGM5\":\"Code Review\",\"aymdcv0bFB\":\"Per seat / month if billed annually. For teams of 2 to 150.\",\"ayxgE4ytwj\":\"Modify prompt\",\"azQRa7pYOp\":\"View changelog\",\"b6NDBQ9q9p\":\"View all results\",\"b6ygXcySyV\":\"Copy\",\"b8CyirwlZS\":\"Read the feature-adoption export\",\"b8b