ob now is to keep as many instances of Claude Code busy as possible.\",\"euiA1H61OH\":\"Customers outside of Europe can follow this process to \u003ca\u003erequest a refund\u003c/a\u003e:\",\"eylXO8YdWn\":\"Build the slide, comps table behind it\",\"f6NhKWst8e\":\"Other plugins\",\"fA/6QacBaf\":\"Prompts \u003e {threshold} tokens\",\"fBG/GeW9Uc\":\"Cost\",\"fC/+2oE3HG\":\"Results for “{query}”\",\"fEE0vf8ygf\":\"Not included\",\"fGpRdLrMdV\":\"Does Claude Code work with the Claude desktop app?\",\"fIg106zNao\":\"slide\",\"fIxDjT+aMY\":\"Splitting decisions from action items first\",\"fL3yWFg4Na\":\"Video player\",\"fPBr/eGp6u\":\"Document Processing \u0026 Extraction\",\"fY8+6FRyY8\":\"Incognito chats\",\"fcJZnHsPVl\":\"$1d\",\"fde27wEzOW\":\"Payment options\",\"filwqDWORF\":\"Read\",\"fio5opLcOZ\":\"Output\",\"fkihPk7bb3\":\"All partners\",\"flmC4rLQFi\":\"Advanced filters\",\"fmU7fKJTzY\":\"Claude Training Sessions\",\"fubYuebYh9\":\"Access anywhere\",\"fvA4lXfkP8\":\""])</script><script nonce="ra8XbZYlV5PcbbCdB45pwg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"Staff Augmentation\",\"fvM1wggKTE\":\"Short, focused reads that break down one idea, workflow, or capability at a time.\",\"fwIt1XEa99\":\"Newest\",\"g/w+MbxOr0\":\"Developer tools\",\"g92wTHEZD1\":\"Go to featured resource {position} of {count}\",\"gB7KNBbkYl\":\"You can change your plan any time in Settings.\",\"gBuMx1gcTM\":\"For large businesses operating at scale\",\"gD8K+LHoq/\":\"Consolidate and flag three variances\",\"gTjHrV/Zd2\":\"Try in Claude\",\"gVc7XkWaqo\":\"Quick access from browser, mobile app, or Claude on desktop. Great for parallel work or on-the-go coding.\",\"gY4tNnNQOH\":\"By purchasing, deploying, accessing, or using this product, you agree to comply with the provider’s terms of service and the terms of any applicable open source software licenses bundled with the product. Providers are responsible for their product descriptions and product content. Anthropic does not warrant provider content is accurate, complete, or error-free.\",\"gczcC5Leue\":\"Subscribe\",\"gfBsTzP5ye\":\"Fable, paid with usage credits\",\"gfLW5gLfXn\":\"Code, apps, and docs that Claude builds for you to use, share, or build on.\",\"gjyzc7CoPw\":\"Table of contents\",\"goHQnK7riz\":\"find service partners\",\"gx7hEPtG+7\":\"DevOps \u0026 Infrastructure Operations\",\"h0W8DMh59C\":\"Time of day\",\"h1ZCL0rm+U\":\"Using CLAUDE.md files\",\"h5xR/rI1JW\":\"Enjoy the video here. Check out other relevant on-demand or upcoming webinars next.\",\"h74ZyMoIiy\":\"Date\",\"h7XvE8ATgC\":\"Previous featured resource\",\"h8BJNSpLyh\":\"Japan\",\"hDI+JMUhFd\":\"Sort by\",\"hFM4GcbPOu\":\"Healthcare \u0026 Life Sciences\",\"hIRpbSURfI\":\"Webinar series registration\",\"hIlb3S7gmj\":\"creative teams\",\"hJZwTSF8Wx\":\"Email address\",\"hVIGR3ZwM1\":\"Start reading\",\"hVIj7YDDnl\":\"Limited\",\"hcYW3zYnp0\":\"Close {heading}\",\"hccqYXg/9+\":\"For asynchronous workloads that can be processed together for better efficiency\",\"hgWdf2UIOg\":\"Claude product overview\",\"hiWuJZvDP+\":\"Related articles\",\"hjGm1j2qcj\":\"Work with the files and folders already on your desktop.\",\"hnrY3LI/l8\":\"Plugin source\",\"hsFxxRwOuF\":\"Play testimonial audio\",\"hvATMfbD6N\":\"Get started with Claude Code\",\"hvD2/48aAq\":\"Admins set user and org spend limits\",\"hySAiYaQPB\":\"Customer story: {name}\",\"hzIXh+zWXq\":\"Sign-in\",\"i6/NVPwbXS\":\"Set org instructions\",\"i6X4YUnoI+\":\"Code execution\",\"iA09r91Nhi\":\"Data Analysis \u0026 Business Intelligence\",\"iKZ+rED3h9\":\"Search the Claude Marketplace\",\"iQYFHFpp2/\":\"Start building\",\"iSqBnkauND\":\"Show featured resource {position} of {count}: {title}\",\"iUZG3VKE6X\":\"Batch\",\"iXpep1vGVo\":\"Recent\",\"iY7lfhlPVd\":\"Keep context, instructions, and files organized by project.\",\"iYRFrGt6Mf\":\"$$200\",\"iZxsimeRjv\":\"Play video: {name}\",\"ia3TbSw0MB\":\"Anthropic Products\",\"igUl+YO/B4\":\"Claude takes real actions on your files and in connected tools. You choose which plugins Claude can use — it works only in the folders and tools you allow.\",\"ih0VppR08P\":\"{n} of {count}\",\"ii5+AISEyS\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits apply\u003c/a\u003e. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"ijMdGR7OO4\":\"Cross-check 34 issues and 34 PRs\",\"inUkccnHv6\":\"Set preferences that apply across every conversation.\",\"ioH+Q/t3aY\":\"See all features and pricing\",\"isGKnzG5uL\":\"Documentation\",\"it6Ligcq3B\":\"Input\",\"iuSNLHoe8Z\":\"Get a comprehensive university‐wide plan for an institution, including its students, faculty, and staff.\",\"iun6grW2C+\":\"Claude Consumption / FinOps Optimisation\",\"iwE5pm/oXq\":\"Contract redline\",\"ize18jQXCF\":\"Now standing: Mondays before staff meeting\",\"j/NXahNfg2\":\"Briefs\",\"j2hlcpE79k\":\"Browser use\",\"jB1nSrwP8X\":\"{count, plural, one {# webinar} other {# webinars}}\",\"jCxscTUx/w\":\"Watch the recording\",\"jI62MY64Qn\":\"Other\",\"jKKg2of6uk\":\"Clear all filters\",\"jLXY9o1l5R\":\"Customer success support at certain spend thresholds\",\"jSd3FgIcuH\":\"Step-by-step walkthroughs and practical playbooks for getting the most out of Claude.\",\"jWt3I/bVbN\":\"Save 50% with batch processing. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\",\"jcwE2sEK9f\":\"Connects with your favorite command line tools\",\"jeFrcRK7Eo\":\"Claude Code is included in your Max plan. Great value for everyday use in larger codebases. Includes $100 per month in API credits.\",\"jewMdfuvaC\":\"{va"])</script><script nonce="ra8XbZYlV5PcbbCdB45pwg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"riant, select, brief {Next brief} report {Next report} other {Next guide}}\",\"jfCrPjcoTy\":\"Alphabetically (Z to A)\",\"jg76pPXsb3\":\"How fast you reach a limit depends on the model you use, how long your chats are, and how large your files are.\",\"jgPXwd1foX\":\"Product:\",\"jhr0P2VITB\":\"Managed AI Operations\",\"jm/spnRSn+\":\"Reset\",\"js+IVaPpb9\":\"Chapter {number}\",\"jsHFp13ghq\":\"Demos, talks, and tutorials from the teams building and using Claude.\",\"jtygmIHCQ1\":\"Education\",\"jvODrZtR+p\":\"Select\",\"jw+K5d+CdN\":\"When used with a Claude Console account, Claude Code consumes API tokens at standard API pricing.\",\"jw7DDs8FJv\":\"Office Locations (On-Site Services)\",\"jx7Hn3QkH8\":\"Article\",\"k0OtSnRsC6\":\"Claude Code is designed with security in mind. When used in your terminal, Claude Code runs locally and talks directly to model APIs without requiring a backend server or remote code index. It also asks for permission before making changes to your files or running commands.\",\"k2veDAJW1p\":\"Write\",\"k4+9FsLhU8\":\"On consumption-based plans.\",\"k8cDUYjZKq\":\"Add to Claude\",\"kBJUtE9oHc\":\"Video\",\"kBa7elYtHL\":\"Earnings comps\",\"kFe6I3hifr\":\"Close capabilities\",\"kG2B8TG1wp\":\"Up to $500/month\",\"kGPBjqFz6l\":\"Prices shown don’t include applicable tax. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"kVrpkF04ro\":\"Webinars\",\"kdUZJIKMMe\":\"Global (any region)\",\"kfiCd53EoX\":\"stories\",\"kh/sk1M1PF\":\"Here are this month’s regional actuals exports. Reconcile them into one summary, flag any variances against budget, and note anything that doesn’t tie out.\",\"khjKGjoVqR\":\"View source\",\"kkjl2vQekD\":\"Max\",\"kkm29b5t2g\":\"Connectors, plugins and API integrations\",\"kmWDaKdQa7\":\"Downgrades take effect at the end of your current billing period, and your chats, projects, and files stay with your account whichever plan you're on.\",\"krcRxpVfJ7\":\"Travel \u0026 Hospitality\",\"ktRQ8OmQ1C\":\"If you're in the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom, and within your 14-day withdrawal period, you can request a refund directly in the app.\",\"kvOMtBRD9I\":\"Credit card\",\"kwoQygB+wc\":\"Canceling doesn't delete your data. Your chats, projects, and files stay with your account, though some features aren't available on the Free plan. For Pro, Max, and Ultra, your account moves to the Free plan once the period ends. For step-by-step help, see \u003ca\u003ehow to cancel a Pro, Max, or Ultra plan\u003c/a\u003e or \u003cb\u003ecancel a Team plan\u003c/b\u003e.\",\"kxmEvL+JcO\":\"\u003ca\u003eMax and Ultra\u003c/a\u003e are built for people who work with Claude throughout the day and want longer, uninterrupted sessions. You get everything in Pro, plus more usage. Max gives you 5x the usage of Pro, every 5 hours and every week. Ultra gives you 10x the weekly usage of Pro, with no 5-hour limit for \u003cb\u003everified accounts\u003c/b\u003e. Both plans include Fable, our top model, for up to half your weekly limit, and a monthly API credit to build on the Claude Platform: $100 on Max, $200 on Ultra. Both plans are billed monthly. See the cards above for current pricing.\",\"kyuy4QAduP\":\"The board deck five. Whatever tier they push hardest.\",\"kzQgd/+809\":\"Product overview\",\"l/bdoV65Uq\":\"Close (Esc)\",\"l0cx8sfvyN\":\"Consultation\",\"l6yCDglZqT\":\"Continue with email\",\"lBAoMMkYNE\":\"Horizontal / Cross-industry\",\"lDLuhpAPUD\":\"Opus\",\"lN0CJi045d\":\"Permissions control\",\"lRdUjp0Vbo\":\"Files and folders\",\"lVREK+O2A7\":\"Claude Security (beta)\",\"lXFbqgnTzj\":\"Hand off and schedule tasks\",\"lbr3Lq2Lnm\":\"Copy link\",\"lbtOA3j+V3\":\"Require that any accounts using your domain migrate to your organization\",\"lcRZ9HSjkB\":\"Administrative tools for Team and Enterprise\",\"lcjzsP/DJa\":\"Per month with annual subscription discount (\u003cannual\u003e$200\u003c/annual\u003e billed up front). \u003cmonthly\u003e$20\u003c/monthly\u003e if billed monthly.\",\"lgU1HeQGw4\":\"Global Premier\",\"lh0xe+kwtT\":\"Works with\",\"ll/ufR0/ED\":\"Trending\",\"lpFUMU324g\":\"Compliance API for observability and monitoring\",\"lu3AvZt5aS\":\"Research, benchmarks, and analysis on how AI is changing the way organizations build, plan, and operate.\",\"ludPcY9ukn\":\"Compare features across plans\",\"lw49qiF68V\":\"Let Claude write and run code to build files like spreadsheets, presentatio"])</script><script nonce="ra8XbZYlV5PcbbCdB45pwg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"ns, and docs for you.\",\"m0TzBiIhvZ\":\"Central billing and administration\",\"m7v1ahj/te\":\"Native extensions for VS Code (+ Cursor, Devin Desktop) and JetBrains IDEs.\",\"mABpZRe7C5\":\"The developer newsletter\",\"mG4nNtNqKg\":\"Updated {date}\",\"mIV5za3QLY\":\"Draft 11 field updates, nothing saved\",\"mKkfuHn2hN\":\"More information\",\"mVaGK86OHA\":\"From {tool}\",\"mVkTZZgH2a\":\"Plugin\",\"mWIVle/RBJ\":\"Date\",\"mWPRGNJ4Uw\":\"Convert EMEA at the July average, 1.088\",\"mWVI74nTV2\":\"Ask and artifact\",\"meOv8JJVYB\":\"Chat with buying specialist\",\"mnJYBQZwb4\":\"Voice\",\"mofX8KnW9/\":\"Claude Code works on macOS, Linux, and Windows. \u003ca\u003eSee full system requirements\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"mscD97HgEg\":\"Managed / Recurring\",\"mwHr7Se8D1\":\"Access to Claude’s latest models for reasoning, coding, and writing.\",\"mxnaO8gi08\":\"Claude lives inside Chrome, ready wherever you browse.\",\"myTIbit5tv\":\"Select partners\",\"mynHYVUSOV\":\"Nordics\",\"n469UeWQIf\":\"Download for ChromeOS\",\"n5D/KuWRGi\":\"Communication\",\"nEA1MxORgH\":\"For {role}\",\"nL8xcmnbjm\":\"Write the digest, what-to-watch first\",\"nOk9mhxGpU\":\"List\",\"nPtgyxpUd0\":\"How do I cancel my Claude subscription?\",\"nScLeP89Ov\":\"Migrate code\",\"nTMLK2RYtE\":\"Deployment Surface\",\"nUT0LvZVOx\":\"Tools\",\"nYokoOMWQh\":\"See solution\",\"nb4F4k82C7\":\"Search {text}\",\"nezp0LIXpQ\":\"Claude Code understands your codebase, edits files, runs commands, and helps you ship faster. It’s Anthropic’s agentic coding tool for your terminal and IDE.\",\"njpnaOi5/X\":\"Resume video\",\"noi6IWMyXA\":\"Project / Program\",\"npxjiYSnPH\":\"v3. Contractors moved to the ops budget.\",\"nx8x3WZ4/G\":\"enterprise security\",\"o+ToCFnM8m\":\"Turn on permissions settings so Claude shows its plan and waits for your approval. Redirect or stop anytime.\",\"o/AcDuEdCh\":\"Create what’s exciting. Maintain what’s essential.\",\"o4eiiyba8k\":\"Compare against Q1\",\"oEZ3tJt0N9\":\"Here’s a list of flagged sites. Visit each one, take a screenshot, and triage it against our trademark enforcement playbook. Rank them by priority.\",\"oFLooU1/QL\":\"{minutes} min remaining\",\"oGju2hB9//\":\"Compliance API\",\"oJiyzDUmhQ\":\"Claude Code has dramatically accelerated our team's coding efficiency. I can now write EDA code in a notebook—pulling data, training a model, and evaluating it with basic metrics—and then ask Claude to convert that into a Metaflow pipeline. This process saves 1-2 days of routine (and often boring!) work per model.\",\"oKdO3Ime5c\":\"Build a social set for the Fall Readout using our brand guidelines. Three 4:5 posts — a stat, a headline, and a trend — as one proof sheet.\",\"oNedMwBIOc\":\"Fable included, up to half your weekly limit\",\"oNxIDnOk31\":\"Post the roll-up in-channel\",\"oUWADlOjJt\":\"No\",\"oZA/6fiLF8\":\"Partner tier\",\"ocMFdUoM0+\":\"{name} is available through the Claude Marketplace. If you have an existing Anthropic commitment, you can apply it here. Contact our team to find the right path for your organization.\",\"odMy5ERU7S\":\"Quick answers or long tasks\",\"ohjvu+C87x\":\"Active users\",\"onyxL5iLxe\":\"{count, plural, other {# more}}\",\"onz7SZxGnk\":\"Build Prototype / POC\",\"otTZisSg5A\":\"If you subscribed through the App Store or Google Play, cancel from that app under Billing \u003e Manage subscription, or directly in your \u003ca\u003eApple\u003c/a\u003e or \u003cb\u003eGoogle Play\u003c/b\u003e account.\",\"ox9wXewvNY\":\"Check the week’s meetings, next team sync Thursday\",\"p556q3uvbn\":\"Copied\",\"p64wBxVoxB\":\"Claude Code maps and explains large codebases in a few seconds. It uses agentic search to understand project structure and dependencies without you having to manually select context files.\",\"p6McXlpoIr\":\"Claude Code for every seat, with self-serve seat management and up to $500 per month in pooled API credits.\",\"p7f+VL1U+Y\":\"Swipe to see more\",\"p8Zpb+X9Sa\":\"You can access Claude Code with a Claude Pro, Max, or Ultra plan, a Team or Enterprise plan, or a Claude Console account. \u003ca\u003eDownload Claude Code\u003c/a\u003e and sign in with your respective Claude or Console credentials.\",\"pCl8kahPwa\":\"Next testimonials\",\"pCyFJadqy/\":\"Simon Last, Co-founder\",\"pFZfPaYqm/\":\"n/a\",\"pGLybCbau7\":\"New connectors\",\"pJx1IlMdHc\":\"Each entry is a fixed snapshot of prices effective on the "])</script><script nonce="ra8XbZYlV5PcbbCdB45pwg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"date shown.\",\"pK+9X32ExT\":\"Access tools\",\"pQmvynhfYT\":\"“\",\"pWPK7z+xaP\":\"{label} — steps\",\"pZ4CtGSlwT\":\"Try Claude\",\"pZf04BdODJ\":\"If you signed up on the web or the desktop app, go to \u003ca\u003eSettings \u003e Billing\u003c/a\u003e and click Cancel.\",\"peouYNi1Sg\":\"Next featured resource\",\"phAZoj/lCl\":\"Collection\",\"pun/KVSUTp\":\"No connectors for those filters\",\"pwjQafECwL\":\"Powered by Claude\",\"pxF+t0PUQJ\":\"Popular\",\"q4mNBvfOdd\":\"Claude Slides\",\"q8HZmBhL9f\":\"$$200 a month in API credits, up from $100 on Max\u003csup\u003e†\u003c/sup\u003e\",\"qANDCowpHs\":\"Knowledge Retrieval \u0026 Enterprise Search\",\"qSEmqaxK/a\":\"Download desktop app\",\"qWb1zA13jM\":\"Rank by risk, critical first\",\"qank7+0V6w\":\"Continue with SSO\",\"qcDygS25FQ\":\"Brief\",\"qhHpS4CiBR\":\"Get Enterprise plan\",\"qoMwDfFqSS\":\"Post the running list to #product-team\",\"qq7/bDb1zJ\":\"Your thinking partner for big ambitions\",\"qqW8aMzEzp\":\"Training Package\",\"qsluU7sYQR\":\"Company size:\",\"r/7WfhmG3M\":\"Matching five transcripts to three open opportunities\",\"r/R93LFqEp\":\"Connectors and plugins\",\"r8XsCUEvou\":\"Connector\",\"rClne6thca\":\"Check this job description against our leveling guide. Give me back an edited version and an interview kit.\",\"rCwYJ1AtP0\":\"financial services\",\"rFNJ5GIHwJ\":\"The challenge\",\"rIAJlEKVw9\":\"Added\",\"rMfXl